  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Resilience Building Fund Programme (ZRBF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the resilience capacity of households affected by climatic shocks and trends through inclusive economic development. The programme will have a risk financing mechanism to make timely, appropriate and predictable funding available for communities that experience large scale humanitarian shocks. The program will also build evidence to improve the policy environment and stimulate service provision to enhance household and community resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
